  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nFINAL WEEKEND OF OPEN HOMES – AUCTION NEXT WEEK!\r\nBeautifully Renovated. A Private St Heliers Retreat.\r\nAuction Wednesday 18 November - Your Opportunity to Secure!\r\n\r\nSecure. Secluded. Beautifully renovated.\r\n\r\nTucked away down a private driveway, this stunning three-bedroom home combines contemporary elegance, exceptional privacy and effortless coastal living, just moments from St Heliers village, the waterfront and Madills Farm.\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated throughout, the home features a stylish entertainer's kitchen with premium Bosch appliances, light-filled living spaces and seamless flow to a sunny, north-facing courtyard.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n3 generous bedrooms and 2 beautifully renovated bathrooms\r\n\r\nTwo separate living areas and two private balconies\r\n\r\nDesigner kitchen with premium Bosch appliances\r\n\r\nSunny, private north-facing courtyard\r\n\r\nQuality finishes, timber flooring and plantation shutters\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage plus 3 off-street parks\r\n\r\nWalking distance to Madills Farm, the waterfront and St Heliers village\r\n\r\nZoned for Kohimarama School and Glendowie College\r\n\r\nBeautifully renovated. Wonderfully private. Perfectly positioned.\r\n\r\nFINAL OPEN HOMES THIS WEEKEND!\r\n\r\nWith the auction next Wednesday, now is the time to take another look and complete your due diligence.\r\n\r\nPrivate viewings available by appointment.\r\n\r\nAll agent conjunctionals are welcome and encouraged.",
